-# TGS Quest 0.8 — command streaming and compatibility test
+# TGS Quest 0.9 — single renderer app
 
-Install the fast APK and select **TGS Quest 0.8 Streaming** after restarting
-ZalithLauncher 2 or DroidBridge. Keep 0.7 installed. The separate Reference APK
-uses the same rendering fixes, but stages indirect commands through BufferSubData
